      "text": "in hidden writings shall gospel be written, 1 Ne. 13:35–36. new writing written upon Liahona, 1 Ne. 16:29. the Lord will give judgment to Moses in writing, 2 Ne. 3:17. Nephi1 is not mighty in writing like unto speaking, 2 Ne. 33:1. on other plates are records of war, according to writings of kings, Jarom 1:14. Aminadi interpreted writing on temple wall, written by finger of God, Alma 10:2. the Lord has not made Nephites mighty in writing, Ether 12:23–26, 40.",
